    has   Marks          RedrawMark[PanelCapacity]       [-]  ?
    has   Namings        const char*[PanelCapacity]      [-]  ?
    has   Enrolled       std::uint32_t                   [-]  ?
    has   QuietCount     std::uint64_t                   [-]  ?
    has   RecordedCount  std::uint64_t                   [-]  ?
    by    Api/ViewportSequence.h, Source/RedrawScheduler.cpp, Source/ViewportSequence.cpp
    note  🔴 ⏱️ The wake rule is the point of this component, not the marks. Under FIFO pacing
    note  ⚠️ Marks do **not** propagate. A subject card marking itself never re-solves the workspace, and a

